    {
      "Original": "Enables when entering a Duty such as Dungeons and Trials.\nDisables after leaving the Duty.",
      "Context": "TiltedUI.DrawTriggersSection",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped",
      "Translated": "进入迷宫或讨伐歼灭战等副本时启用。\n离开副本时停用。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Enables when entering combat.\nWaits \"Timeout\" seconds after leaving combat before disabling.\nClick \"Set\" to copy Auto-sheathe timer.",
      "Context": "TiltedUI.DrawTriggersSection",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped",
      "Translated": "进入战斗时启用。\n脱战后等待「超时时间」所设的秒数再停用。\n点击「设置」可复制自动收起武器的等待时间。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Enables when flying on a Mount.\nDisables when landed.",
      "Context": "TiltedUI.DrawTriggersSection",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped",
      "Translated": "骑乘坐骑飞行时启用。\n着陆时停用。",
