    {
      "Original": "Tweaks the camera distance (Zoom).\nOnly happens when transitioning between states\nSmoothing is always applied.\nClick \"Set\" to copy the current camera distance.\n(Disabled when using Zoomed trigger.",
      "Context": "TiltedUI.DrawCameraDistanceSection",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped",
      "Translated": "调整镜头距离（缩放）。\n仅在切换状态时改变距离，\n始终使用平滑过渡。\n点击「设置」可复制当前镜头距离。\n（使用镜头拉近触发条件时停用。）",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Weapon Sheathed",
      "Context": "TiltedUI.DrawTriggersSection",
